{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、NOGIBINGO!2最終回ですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーにもチャンスがあって\nほんと自分次第の番組だなって思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり\nチャンスをモノにはできてなかったのは\n心残りだけど\n収録は楽しかったな〜(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終回は\nちょっと\nNOGIBINGO!らしくない感じになってます(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、それはそれで\nすごい良い回になってると思います`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の深夜見てね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/28/1843094/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェで新発売の飲み物が出たら\n試す？それとも安定の飲み物？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n期間限定に弱いから\n美味しそうだったら飲むし\n好きじゃなさそうだなって思ったら\n試さないかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DVDはどのジャンルが好みなの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n洋画よりは邦画が好きかな！\nでもこの前のコメで書いてくれたの\n一応全部メモったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/28/1843094/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/28/1843094/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ、真夏、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここで\n未央奈ちゃんがうちの顔が好きって\n言ってくれたのを見て\nママが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":